    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Memorize the cards. Capture the channel. Win!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Panama Canal Clash&quot; is a classic memorial game with geopolitical overtones! The Panama Canal has become the scene of a confrontation between the US and China. Choose your side and play out the key events in the struggle for the strategic waterway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task is to find the paired cards that symbolize the influence of your faction. But be careful: memorizing the arrangement of the cards is one thing, but winning the battle for supremacy is quite another!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf Two sets of cards - 5 unique cards for each faction (USA vs China).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Pump up your memory - classic memory mechanics in a political setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Choose your side - become the economic wizard of the USA or the strategist of China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad Vivid cartoon illustrations - memorize events with a dose of irony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 Compete with friends - who can memorize and find all the paired cards faster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who will become the master of the Panama Canal? Everything will be decided in the game Panama Canal Clash!</p>",
